        <body>
            <div xml:id="d351">

                <pb facs="0628" n="494" sameAs="frus:frus1888p1/pg494"/>

                <head>No. 351.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. McLane to Mr. Bayard.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1887-11-18"><hi rendition="#italic">November</hi> 18, 1887</date>.
                        (Received November 29.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 505.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to transmit herewith a
                    bronze medal which the committee of the Bartholdi statue had struck in honor of
                    the President to commemorate his participation in the inauguration of the Statue
                    of Liberty last year at New York. The medal is accompanied by a letter addressed
                    to the President and signed by M. de Lesseps, who is the president of the
                    committee. I also inclose a translation of the same.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert M.
                            McLane.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d351-a1.xml" xpointer="d351-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
